{"id":"9e103ef3650d4a1e","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-generic-delta-exists.md","title":"可由有限跳跃计算的n泛型存在","display":"thm-generic-delta-exists — 可由有限跳跃计算的n泛型存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-generic-delta-exists","aliases":["43-thm-generic-delta-exists"],"display":"thm-generic-delta-exists — 可由有限跳跃计算的n泛型存在","depends_on":["[[43-df-genericity]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§11.15.1, paragraph after Theorem 11.15.3","source_printed_pages":"286","source_pdf_pages":"306","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-generic-delta-exists"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-generic-delta-exists</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-delta-exists — 可由有限跳跃计算的n泛型存在"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.15.1, paragraph after Theorem 11.15.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"286"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"306"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{NGeneric}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a>，跳跃迭代和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists G\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,n)\\land G\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n)}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists G\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,n)\\land G\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n)}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>以∅^(n)判断当前有限串是否有延伸落入第e个Σ_n串集；若有就选一个，否则当前串已决定避免。每步另延伸至少一位，所获并集总定义，并逐项满足所有要求。这里是存在性，不声称能在无oracle下有效列出全部泛型点。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§11.15.1, paragraph after Theorem 11.15.3，印刷页286，PDF页306。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genericity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\ge1$；$\\operatorname{NGeneric}$ 采用 [[43-df-genericity]]，跳跃迭代和 $\\le_T$ 采用 [[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\ge1$；$\\operatorname{NGeneric}$ 采用 [[43-df-genericity]]，跳跃迭代和 $\\le_T$ 采用 [[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\ge1$；$\\operatorname{NGeneric}$ 采用 [[43-df-genericity]]，跳跃迭代和 $\\le_T$ 采用 [[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NGeneric}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists G\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,n)\\land G\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n)}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1522,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-267","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-generic-delta-exists]] — 可由有限跳跃计算的n泛型存在"}],"outgoing":["39322da73a94b6b8","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}